{"id":51758,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51758"},"modified":"2026-10-16T09:38:09","modified_gmt":"2026-10-16T08:38:09","slug":"vb-trail-run","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/vb-trail-run\/","title":{"rendered":"VB Trail Run 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">VB Trail Run 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">VB Trail Run 2026<\/strong> (5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Vila Baleeira Trail Run) realiza-se no domingo, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">15 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, no concelho das <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Lajes do Pico<\/strong>, na <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Ilha do Pico (A\u00e7ores)<\/strong>. Organizado pelo <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Gabinete de Desporto da C\u00e2mara Municipal das Lajes do Pico<\/strong>, o evento percorre trilhos vulc\u00e2nicos, caminhos agr\u00edcolas, zonas florestais e linhas de \u00e1gua da hist\u00f3rica Vila Baleeira, acolhendo nesta edi\u00e7\u00e3o a prestigiada <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Final da Ta\u00e7a de Portugal de Trail da ATRP<\/strong> (\u00e9poca 2025\/2026) na dist\u00e2ncia rainha de 30 km. Prepara a tua estrat\u00e9gia na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e consulta o guia completo de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail-running-portugal\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partida e chegada no emblem\u00e1tico <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Jardim da Baleia<\/strong>, nas Lajes do Pico, o programa competitivo integra tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias cronometradas: o exigente <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">VBT Trail 30 km<\/strong> (2500m D+, Grau 3 ATRP, partida \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">08:30<\/strong>), o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">VBT Trail Sprint 18 km<\/strong> (1100m D+, Grau 3 ATRP, partida \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10:00<\/strong>, que atribui pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios de 300 \u20ac, 150 \u20ac e 100 \u20ac ao top 3 absoluto masculino e feminino) e o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">VBT Trail Curto 10 km<\/strong> (400m D+, Grau 2 ATRP, partida \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10:00<\/strong>), acompanhados pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">SLOW VBT Caminhada de 8 km<\/strong> (200m D+, partida \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10:00<\/strong>).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Limitado a 500 participantes no conjunto das quatro provas, o Vila Baleeira Trail Run inclui no valor de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, saco de atleta, dorsal com chip, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, lembran\u00e7a finisher, duches e o tradicional <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Jantar Conv\u00edvio e Cerim\u00f3nia de Entrega de Pr\u00e9mios<\/strong> \u00e0s 19:00 no Jardim da Baleia.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">15 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-b