al\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">7h30 (30 km) \/ 5h00 (18 km, 10 km e 8 km)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/storage\/events\/vb-trail-run-2026\/69a24624edebb_REGULAMENTO VBT 2026 - Versa\u0303o 1.0.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Longo<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">VBT Trail 30 km (Final Ta\u00e7a Portugal ATRP)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\u23f0 Partida: 08:30 \u2022 2500m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00danica:<\/strong> 15,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">VBT Trail Sprint 18 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\u23f0 Partida: 10:00 \u2022 1100m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00danica:<\/strong> 10,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">VBT Trail Curto 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\u23f0 Partida: 10:00 \u2022 400m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00danica:<\/strong> 5,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">SLOW VBT Caminhada 8 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\u23f0 Partida: 10:00 \u2022 200m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00danica:<\/strong> 1,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o VB Trail Run 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Vila Baleeira Trail Run realiza-se no domingo, 15 de novembro de 2026, com partida e chegada no Jardim da Baleia, nas Lajes do Pico (Ilha do Pico, A\u00e7ores). O VBT Trail 30 km parte \u00e0s 08:30 e o Trail Sprint 18 km, Trail Curto 10 km e Caminhada 8 km partem \u00e0s 10:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo no kit de atleta?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 31 de outubro de 2026 (limitadas a 500 vagas) com taxas \u00fanicas: 15,00 \u20ac no VBT Trail 30 km, 10,00 \u20ac no VBT Trail Sprint 18 km, 5,00 \u20ac no VBT Trail Curto 10 km e 1,00 \u20ac na Caminhada de 8 km. Inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, saco de atleta, dorsal com chip, seguro, abastecimentos, duches, lembran\u00e7a finisher e jantar conv\u00edvio \u00e0s 19:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os tempos limite e barreiras hor\u00e1rias das provas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O VBT Trail 30 km (2500m D+) tem um tempo limite total de 7h30 e uma barreira hor\u00e1ria interm\u00e9dia \u00e0s 5h30 de prova (14:00 locais) no PA3 \u2013 Sal\u00e3o das Terras. As provas de 18 km (1100m D+), 10 km (400m D+) e 8 km (200m D+) t\u00eam um tempo limite de 5h00, encerrando a meta \u00e0s 16:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido aos atletas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todos os participantes devem transportar dorsal vis\u00edvel, mochila ou cinto de hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o, telem\u00f3vel operacional, manta t\u00e9rmica, apito e imperme\u00e1vel\/corta-vento. No VBT Trail 30 km \u00e9 exigido dep\u00f3sito de \u00e1gua de 1 litro e frontal de luz ou lanterna; nas provas de 18 km, 10 km e 8 km o dep\u00f3sito m\u00ednimo \u00e9 de 250\/500 ml (n\u00e3o h\u00e1 copos nos abastecimentos).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona na Galeria Municipal (Jardim da Baleia, Lajes do Pico) no s\u00e1bado, 14 de novembro, das 10:00 \u00e0s 19:00, e no domingo, 15 de novembro, das 07:00 \u00e0s 08:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"VB Trail Run 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-15\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Jardim da Baleia, Lajes do Pico, Ilha do Pico\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Lajes do Pico\", \"addressRegion\": \"A\u00e7ores\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Gabinete de Desporto da C\u00e2mara Municipal das Lajes do Pico\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o VB Trail Run 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Vila Baleeira Trail Run realiza-se no domingo, 15 de novembro de 2026, com partida e chegada no Jardim da Baleia, nas Lajes do Pico (Ilha do Pico, A\u00e7ores). O VBT Trail 30 km parte \u00e0s 08:30 e o Trail Sprint 18 km, Trail Curto 10 km e Caminhada 8 km partem \u00e0s 10:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo no kit de atleta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 31 de outubro de 2026 (limitadas a 500 vagas) com taxas \u00fanicas: 15,00 \u20ac no VBT Trail 30 km, 10,00 \u20ac no VBT Trail Sprint 18 km, 5,00 \u20ac no VBT Trail Curto 10 km e 1,00 \u20ac na Caminhada de 8 km. Inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, saco de atleta, dorsal com chip, seguro, abastecimentos, duches, lembran\u00e7a finisher e jantar conv\u00edvio \u00e0s 19:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os tempos limite e barreiras hor\u00e1rias das provas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O VBT Trail 30 km (2500m D+) tem um tempo limite total de 7h30 e uma barreira hor\u00e1ria interm\u00e9dia \u00e0s 5h30 de prova (14:00 locais) no PA3 \u2013 Sal\u00e3o das Terras. As provas de 18 km (1100m D+), 10 km (400m D+) e 8 km (200m D+) t\u00eam um tempo limite de 5h00, encerrando a meta \u00e0s 16:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido aos atletas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Todos os participantes devem transportar dorsal vis\u00edvel, mochila ou cinto de hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o, telem\u00f3vel operacional, manta t\u00e9rmica, apito e imperme\u00e1vel\/corta-vento. No VBT Trail 30 km \u00e9 exigido dep\u00f3sito de \u00e1gua de 1 litro e frontal de luz ou lanterna; nas provas de 18 km, 10 km e 8 km o dep\u00f3sito m\u00ednimo \u00e9 de 250\/500 ml (n\u00e3o h\u00e1 copos nos abastecimentos).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado funciona na Galeria Municipal (Jardim da Baleia, Lajes do Pico) no s\u00e1bado, 14 de novembro, das 10:00 \u00e0s 19:00, e no domingo, 15 de novembro, das 07:00 \u00e0s 08:00.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":69669,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"close